\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec3 Hi John,\
\
\'a0I was aware of your development of the github site. A very worthy development. A couple of things I have learnt in my historical excursions are the unreliability of oral histories (including my own!) and how much we are likely to lose of the primary records now that many are electronic.\
\
I have been in contact with Graeme, and as a result, I added a note in the proof regarding the possible initiator of the scheme. \'a0I'm inclined to credit it to Blatt, but Bosson would have had to support it and steer the formal scheme through the bureaucracy.\'a0\
\
Look forward to seeing you in September.\
\
Regards, Michael\
\
